OL,3,GNEWSAProposed cost of living help for
OL,4,Afamilies welcomed
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents and a children's charity have
OL,7,Fwelcomed measures in the government's
OL,8,Fproposed budget to help families with
OL,9,Fthe cost of living.
OL,11,FThe Jersey government proposes doubling
OL,12,Fthe parental grant, increasing free
OL,13,Fnursery hours for 2-3 year olds from 15
OL,14,Fhours to 20 hours and giving families
OL,15,Fwho earn #80,000 or less a family
OL,16,Fsupport payment of #250 for every
OL,17,Fschool age child.
OL,19,FFiona Vacher from the Jersey Child Care
OL,20,FTrust (JCCT) described these as
OL,21,F"significant increases."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
